          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best treadmill for walking only?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                The Sole F63 is our overall pick for walking-only use. It pairs
                a full 20 x 60-inch deck with cushioning that stayed consistent
